  ('fb69c2d9-5274-5c22-8463-38c83f170b82', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g12-writing-with-evidence'), null, 'medium',
   $q$Which sentence, placed in the blank at sentence 9, best responds to the objection in sentence 8?$q$, $q$[{"text":"However, Mthembu admits that weather can affect how many runners are able to finish any marathon.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"concedes-without-rebuttal"},{"text":"However, Mthembu reports that many runners prefer cool weather because it keeps them from overheating.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"does-not-address-objection"},{"text":"However, Mthembu reports that race-day temperatures were about the same in the four years before and after 2018.","is_correct":true},{"text":"However, Mthembu reports that the number of entrants grew steadily each year after pace groups began.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-statistic"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$However, Mthembu reports that race-day temperatures were about the same in the four years before and after 2018.$q$, $q$If the weather was about the same before and after 2018, it cannot explain the rise in finishers, so this evidence answers the objection directly. Admitting that weather matters only agrees with the objection without showing it is wrong here.$q$, 'draft', '8fa8f357-fefe-5276-8bda-5e42f95a881d')
