  ('b1713161-8089-5374-91aa-fc9f8120872e', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g12-writing-with-evidence'), null, 'medium',
   $q$Which revision of sentence 12 best concludes the draft?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Overall, Bakr's report shows that the market turned Mercer Street into a place residents use at night.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Overall, Bakr's report shows that every small town should close its main street to cars on weekends.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overgeneralization"},{"text":"Overall, Bakr's report shows that the apartment building had no effect on Mercer Street's shops.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overstates-evidence"},{"text":"Overall, Bakr's report shows that eleven shops on Mercer Street now stay open until nine o'clock.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"evidence-without-analysis"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Overall, Bakr's report shows that the market turned Mercer Street into a place residents use at night.$q$, $q$The correct conclusion restates Bakr's claim about how residents think about the street after dark, which the shop hours support. The apartment version claims more than sentence 11 shows, since the timing only suggests the market came first.$q$, 'draft', 'c1b0f55b-26fe-5cb1-a767-e8fc11297af6')
