   $q$Which sentence, placed in the blank at sentence 9, would best support the idea in sentence 7?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The tagged dragonflies were most active hunting smaller insects during the warm hours just after noon.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-detail"},{"text":"The few dragonflies tracked flying far on calm days used up their stored fat much faster per kilometer than the others.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Faleolo's team had first expected the dragonflies to fly a short distance each day, like many songbirds.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"repeats-without-support"},{"text":"Cold fronts in the region usually arrive every five to eight days during the autumn months.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"context-not-support"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The few dragonflies tracked flying far on calm days used up their stored fat much faster per kilometer than the others.$q$, $q$Sentence 7 claims the wind saves the insects energy, and fat burning faster on calm days is direct evidence of that energy cost. The cold front timing explains how often good winds come, but it says nothing about energy.$q$, 'draft', 'cb089783-aab3-5f17-8e7f-a0da3a07aa3b')
